{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1576", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1576/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1576/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1576/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1576", "id": 1031454425, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s49er7Z", "number": 1576, "title": "mavsdk_server_linux-arm64-musl binary did not work on the actual drone", "user": {"login": "YalamareddyChaitanya", "id": 70040710, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDQwNzEw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70040710?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya", "html_url": "https://github.com/YalamareddyChaitanya", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2021-10-20T14:05:01Z", "updated_at": "2021-10-21T09:55:43Z", "closed_at": "2021-10-21T09:55:42Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I have two mavsdk servers (one is built from the source  and the other one is the binary file \"mavsdk_server_linux-arm64-musl\" downloaded from the release ) on the drone( aarch64 architecture ).\r\n\r\nWhen I started mavsdk server which is built from the source,  server successfully connected to the drone.\r\n\r\n![mavsdk1](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/70040710/138106259-cb44a03d-c78d-4180-b21d-d5b3cba97bbe.png)\r\n\r\nWhen I started mavsdk binary downloaded from github, server did not connect to the drone.\r\n \r\n![mavsdk2](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/70040710/138106930-9e4a430e-332a-4de9-9c35-ba5e5d4205c7.png)\r\n\r\nI am still a beginner. I would like to know whether the arm64 binary works on all the drones with aarch64 architecture or Did I miss something? \r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "YalamareddyChaitanya", "id": 70040710, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDQwNzEw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70040710?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya", "html_url": "https://github.com/YalamareddyChaitanya", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1576/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1576/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/947861172", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1576#issuecomment-947861172", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1576", "id": 947861172, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s44fza0", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2021-10-20T17:04:47Z", "updated_at": "2021-10-20T17:05:28Z", "body": "Looking at your logs above, one time you run it with `./start-mavsdk-server.sh`, which apparently runs something like `./mavsdk_server udp://:14551`. The other time, you run something like `./mavsdk_server`, which is equivalent to `./mavsdk_server udp://:14540`.\r\n\r\nTherefore the second instance does not discover your drone because apparently your drone sends mavlink on udp 14551.\r\n\r\nRun this instead:\r\n\r\n```\r\n./mavsdk_server_linux-arm64-musl udp://:14551\r\n```", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/947861172/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/948447712", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1576#issuecomment-948447712", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1576", "id": 948447712, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s44iCng", "user": {"login": "YalamareddyChaitanya", "id": 70040710, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDQwNzEw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70040710?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya", "html_url": "https://github.com/YalamareddyChaitanya", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YalamareddyChaitanya/repos", "events_url": "https: